{
  "name": "delete-campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "delete-campaign",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-1",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "delete-campaign",
      "notes": "Called by ClientDetailPage.tsx's per-campaign Delete button. Payload: { campaign_id }. Waits for the workflow to finish (default response mode) before responding, so the frontend can safely remove the row from its view only after this confirms the delete actually happened."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const id = $json.body.campaign_id;\nconst uuidRe = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i;\nif (typeof id !== 'string' || !uuidRe.test(id)) {\n  throw new Error('campaign_id missing or not a valid UUID: ' + JSON.stringify(id));\n}\nreturn [{ json: { campaign_id: id } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "validate-1",
      "name": "Validate campaign_id",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        20,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "google_ads_settings",
        "limit": 1,
        "filterType": "none"
      },
      "id": "get-creds-1",
      "name": "Get Google Ads credentials",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "gW3hdy107B2DtcxQ",
          "name": "Supabase Google Ads"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "get",
        "tableId": "campaigns",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Validate campaign_id').item.json.campaign_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "get-campaign-1",
      "name": "Get campaign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "gW3hdy107B2DtcxQ",
          "name": "Supabase Google Ads"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ !!$json.google_ads_campaign_resource }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "built-if-1",
      "name": "Built in Google Ads?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "A campaign that never made it past 'pending'/'error' (no google_ads_campaign_resource yet) has nothing to remove on the Google Ads side -- just delete the Supabase row directly."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const row = $('Get campaign').item.json;\nconst DIRECT_ACCESS_CUSTOMER_IDS = ['3534195221'];\nconst customerId = String(row.google_ads_customer_id).replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\nconst mccCustomerId = $('Get Google Ads credentials').item.json.mcc_customer_id;\nconst loginCustomerId = DIRECT_ACCESS_CUSTOMER_IDS.includes(customerId) ? '' : mccCustomerId;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    customerId,\n    loginCustomerId,\n    campaignResource: row.google_ads_campaign_resource,\n  },\n}];\n"
      },
      "id": "prepare-removal-1",
      "name": "Prepare removal context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "client_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Get Google Ads credentials').item.json.client_id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "client_secret",
              "value": "={{ $('Get Google Ads credentials').item.json.client_secret }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "refresh_token",
              "value": "={{ $('Get Google Ads credentials').item.json.refresh_token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "grant_type",
              "value": "refresh_token"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "refresh-token-1",
      "name": "Refresh Google Ads token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://googleads.googleapis.com/v25/customers/{{ $('Prepare removal context').item.json.customerId }}/campaigns:mutate",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyHeaders": "json",
        "jsonHeaders": "={{ JSON.stringify(Object.assign(\n  {\n    \"Authorization\": \"Bearer \" + $('Refresh Google Ads token').item.json.access_token,\n    \"developer-token\": $('Get Google Ads credentials').item.json.developer_token,\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n  },\n  $('Prepare removal context').item.json.loginCustomerId\n    ? { \"login-customer-id\": $('Prepare removal context').item.json.loginCustomerId }\n    : {}\n)) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ operations: [{ remove: $('Prepare removal context').item.json.campaignResource }] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "remove-campaign-1",
      "name": "Remove campaign in Google Ads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        200
      ],
      "notes": "Google Ads never hard-deletes a campaign -- 'remove' sets campaign.status to REMOVED. That's exactly what sync-metrics.json's discovery query already filters on (WHERE campaign.status != 'REMOVED') and what the sync's campaign-config branch now checks per-campaign to delete the Supabase row when Google Ads reports it removed -- this workflow and that check agree on the same convention."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "delete",
        "tableId": "campaigns",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Validate campaign_id').item.json.campaign_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "delete-row-1",
      "name": "Delete campaign row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "gW3hdy107B2DtcxQ",
          "name": "Supabase Google Ads"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Fed by both IF branches -- reached either after Google Ads confirms the remove, or directly when the campaign was never built there."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
